Hi,

Speakers - please volunteer to present on your favorite topic.

Here is the list of topics from our Joint PWG/OP Summit in May 2013:

- OP Plenary
- CUPS Plenary
- OP - Print Clients
-- CUPS filters
-- GNOME printing
-- Mobile printing
- OP - Color Management
- OP - Ghostscript
- OP - Print Drivers

Please suggest other topics.  Since this is a joint meeting with PWG,
new IPP features (FaxOut, Scan, etc.) and PWG IPP Everywhere logo
certification will be discussed in the PWG IPP sessions.

Cheers,
- Ira


